 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time Complexity:** $O(W \times H)$ for 2D and $O(S_x \times S_y \times S_z)$ for 3D, as every grid point must be computed [S2, S5, unofficial].
+- **Time Complexity:** $O(W \times H)$ for 2D and $O(S_x \times S_y \times S_z)$ for 3D, as every grid point must be computed [S2, unofficial][S5, unofficial].
 - **Memory Complexity:** $O(W \times H \times D)$ where $D$ is the dimensionality (2 or 3) [S2, unofficial]. For 3D with cell attributes, $O(S_x S_y S_z \times \text{info\_size})$ [S5, unofficial].
-- **Performance:** Highly parallelizable on GPU using tensor operations. Generation is typically instantaneous for resolutions up to $1024^2$ or $256^3$ on modern GPUs [S5, unofficial].
-- **Strengths:** Provides exact, differentiable coordinate mappings essential for neural rendering and SDF optimization [S2, S5, unofficial].
